      "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_01.mp3",
      "text": "You were a prodigy, McGinnis.",
      "duration": 2.445
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "character": "Mcginnis",
      "audioFile": "forge_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/forge_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_02.mp3",
      "text": "I still am.",
      "duration": 1.07
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Seven",
      "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_03.mp3",
      "text": "I think it's safe to say you plateaued",
      "duration": 2.573
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Mcginnis",
      "audioFile": "forge_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/forge_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_04.mp3",
      "text": "I'm sorry, what did you say?",
      "duration": 1.473
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "character": "Seven",
      "audioFile": "gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_05",
      "audioUrl": "audio/gigawatt_match_start_gigawatt_forge_convo03_05.mp3",
      "text": "You are a woman who executes pedestrian ideas at the highest level.  That makes you a master crafstman, but far from a visionary.",
      "duration": 7.561
    }
  ]
